WEBVTT

00:00:01.650 --> 00:00:04.050 line:65% position:50% align:center size:92%
This is Liao Shutao's story.

00:00:05.110 --> 00:00:12.310 line:65% position:50% align:center size:92%
He never imagined that one day he would
encounter Jesus along life's journey.

00:00:15.260 --> 00:00:19.620 line:65% position:50% align:center size:92%
Having grown up with a scientific
education, I had always felt certain of
one

00:00:19.620 --> 00:00:19.960 line:65% position:50% align:center size:92%
thing:

00:00:20.500 --> 00:00:27.415 line:65% position:50% align:center size:92%
If science and faith stood before truth
and asked it to choose, truth would

00:00:27.415 --> 00:00:29.720 line:65% position:50% align:center size:92%
surely side with science.

00:00:29.720 --> 00:00:36.350 line:65% position:50% align:center size:92%
Yet truth's choice was so hard to
believe that I wondered whether my whole
life

00:00:36.350 --> 00:00:38.700 line:65% position:50% align:center size:92%
until then had been a dream.

00:00:38.700 --> 00:00:44.680 line:65% position:50% align:center size:92%
Liao Shutao was a man deeply shaped by
science.

00:00:45.540 --> 00:00:48.640 line:65% position:50% align:center size:92%
During his passionate university years,

00:00:49.240 --> 00:00:54.940 line:65% position:50% align:center size:92%
He was immersed in an atmosphere that
honored freedom and the pursuit of
truth.

00:00:56.400 --> 00:01:00.440 line:65% position:50% align:center size:92%
Ideals and passion surged within him.

00:01:01.780 --> 00:01:06.840 line:65% position:50% align:center size:92%
An open academic climate let him see
people in every field

00:01:06.840 --> 00:01:13.447 line:65% position:50% align:center size:92%
ranging freely like untethered horses,
pursuing truth in the natural and social

00:01:13.447 --> 00:01:14.200 line:65% position:50% align:center size:92%
sciences.

00:01:15.770 --> 00:01:23.978 line:65% position:50% align:center size:92%
Four years of university taught me to
prize rational thought, empiricism, and
an

00:01:23.978 --> 00:01:26.030 line:65% position:50% align:center size:92%
insistence on facts.

00:01:26.030 --> 00:01:33.687 line:65% position:50% align:center size:92%
I believed that only careful,
independent thought could test every
idea and

00:01:33.687 --> 00:01:36.750 line:65% position:50% align:center size:92%
piece of knowledge I accepted.

00:01:36.750 --> 00:01:41.910 line:65% position:50% align:center size:92%
Only then could I develop a more mature
confidence in who I was,

00:01:41.910 --> 00:01:47.270 line:65% position:50% align:center size:92%
and understand more deeply the meaning
and value of our existence.

00:01:47.950 --> 00:01:50.490 line:65% position:50% align:center size:92%
I also learned how precious freedom is.

00:01:50.490 --> 00:01:58.101 line:65% position:50% align:center size:92%
Freedom lets human thought roam, giving
rise to the flourishing achievements of

00:01:58.101 --> 00:01:59.450 line:65% position:50% align:center size:92%
science today.

00:01:59.970 --> 00:02:06.990 line:65% position:50% align:center size:92%
Because we cherish our own freedom, we
learn to set boundaries and respect the

00:02:06.990 --> 00:02:08.610 line:65% position:50% align:center size:92%
freedom of others.

00:02:08.610 --> 00:02:16.370 line:65% position:50% align:center size:92%
After graduation, military service, and
work, he married.

00:02:17.430 --> 00:02:23.635 line:65% position:50% align:center size:92%
The couple then moved to the United
States to study at the University of
Texas

00:02:23.635 --> 00:02:24.430 line:65% position:50% align:center size:92%
at Austin.

00:02:24.430 --> 00:02:29.182 line:65% position:50% align:center size:92%
Liao pursued a master's degree in
mechanics and a doctorate in civil

00:02:29.182 --> 00:02:30.020 line:65% position:50% align:center size:92%
engineering.

00:02:30.640 --> 00:02:35.320 line:65% position:50% align:center size:92%
His wife entered a doctoral program in
molecular biology and genetics.

00:02:36.690 --> 00:02:41.710 line:65% position:50% align:center size:92%
It was a completely different country.
Everything felt fresh and full of joy.

00:02:43.150 --> 00:02:47.370 line:65% position:50% align:center size:92%
The beautiful, comfortable library
became his favorite place.

00:02:49.440 --> 00:02:58.073 line:65% position:50% align:center size:92%
As he carefully pursued facts and truth,
he grew happier and more assured in his

00:02:58.073 --> 00:02:58.720 line:65% position:50% align:center size:92%
steps.

00:02:58.720 --> 00:03:07.972 line:65% position:50% align:center size:92%
Something remarkable happened one day in
1994, my fifth year of study in

00:03:07.972 --> 00:03:09.000 line:65% position:50% align:center size:92%
America.

00:03:09.000 --> 00:03:14.944 line:65% position:50% align:center size:92%
I came out of the university's Main
Building and suddenly felt like turning

00:03:14.944 --> 00:03:15.420 line:65% position:50% align:center size:92%
around

00:03:15.420 --> 00:03:23.242 line:65% position:50% align:center size:92%
to admire its magnificent twenty-seven-
story tower. The university is famous
and

00:03:23.242 --> 00:03:25.100 line:65% position:50% align:center size:92%
over a century old.

00:03:25.100 --> 00:03:30.620 line:65% position:50% align:center size:92%
As I turned to look, I suddenly noticed

00:03:30.620 --> 00:03:37.800 line:65% position:50% align:center size:92%
a line carved into the weathered marble
above the entrance:

00:03:37.800 --> 00:03:42.000 line:65% position:50% align:center size:92%
Ye shall know the truth and the truth
shall make you free.

00:03:42.560 --> 00:03:48.805 line:65% position:50% align:center size:92%
At that moment, words flashed through my
mind more forcefully than the

00:03:48.805 --> 00:03:50.500 line:65% position:50% align:center size:92%
inscription itself:

00:03:50.500 --> 00:03:52.460 line:65% position:50% align:center size:92%
You must seek the truth.

00:03:52.460 --> 00:03:55.000 line:65% position:50% align:center size:92%
The truth will set you free.

00:03:55.000 --> 00:04:02.840 line:65% position:50% align:center size:92%
Those words shook me profoundly.
Suddenly, I felt that everything made
sense.

00:04:02.840 --> 00:04:10.724 line:65% position:50% align:center size:92%
I thought only a great philosopher of
the Renaissance could have spoken such

00:04:10.724 --> 00:04:12.280 line:65% position:50% align:center size:92%
timeless words.

00:04:12.280 --> 00:04:17.200 line:65% position:50% align:center size:92%
I thought they had inspired the West to
pursue truth,

00:04:17.200 --> 00:04:23.380 line:65% position:50% align:center size:92%
and to establish universities devoted to
that pursuit.

00:04:23.960 --> 00:04:31.753 line:65% position:50% align:center size:92%
To me, this explained why their
scientific achievements had given them
global

00:04:31.753 --> 00:04:32.360 line:65% position:50% align:center size:92%
power.

00:04:32.360 --> 00:04:37.200 line:65% position:50% align:center size:92%
I even thought I had understood the
reason for China's long-standing
weakness.

00:04:37.200 --> 00:04:44.200 line:65% position:50% align:center size:92%
From then on, he regarded those words as
the greatest saying of all.

00:04:45.060 --> 00:04:49.280 line:65% position:50% align:center size:92%
He admired its author as a giant among
great thinkers,

00:04:49.280 --> 00:04:55.283 line:65% position:50% align:center size:92%
one who saw and precisely expressed the
close link between truth and freedom,

00:04:55.283 --> 00:04:57.700 line:65% position:50% align:center size:92%
two seemingly unrelated things.

00:04:57.700 --> 00:05:04.520 line:65% position:50% align:center size:92%
At the end of that year, Liao completed
his doctorate.

00:05:05.400 --> 00:05:12.260 line:65% position:50% align:center size:92%
But without warning, his family life
entered turbulent waters.

00:05:13.920 --> 00:05:21.090 line:65% position:50% align:center size:92%
My joy at finishing my studies coincided
with the hardest period in my beloved

00:05:21.090 --> 00:05:23.020 line:65% position:50% align:center size:92%
wife's academic life.

00:05:23.560 --> 00:05:29.953 line:65% position:50% align:center size:92%
She had spent six years pursuing her
doctorate, with no sign of being able to

00:05:29.953 --> 00:05:30.700 line:65% position:50% align:center size:92%
graduate.

00:05:30.700 --> 00:05:37.180 line:65% position:50% align:center size:92%
She worked on experiments day and night,
only to face repeated failures.

00:05:37.700 --> 00:05:41.040 line:65% position:50% align:center size:92%
The pressure often made her wake in the
night and cry.

00:05:41.660 --> 00:05:47.272 line:65% position:50% align:center size:92%
Sometimes, when she woke in the morning,
there would be a clump of hair on the

00:05:47.272 --> 00:05:47.560 line:65% position:50% align:center size:92%
bed.

00:05:47.560 --> 00:05:51.640 line:65% position:50% align:center size:92%
Then she became pregnant.

00:05:51.640 --> 00:05:56.560 line:65% position:50% align:center size:92%
We were overjoyed, yet unsure how to
face the future.

00:05:58.000 --> 00:06:03.700 line:65% position:50% align:center size:92%
In fact, whether she eventually earned
her doctorate did not matter much to me.

00:06:03.700 --> 00:06:07.880 line:65% position:50% align:center size:92%
So I decided to return to Taiwan and
take a teaching position.

00:06:07.880 --> 00:06:14.140 line:65% position:50% align:center size:92%
That September, I returned to Taiwan
alone to teach,

00:06:15.000 --> 00:06:19.000 line:65% position:50% align:center size:92%
leaving her in America on her own, with
a baby on the way.

00:06:19.640 --> 00:06:21.900 line:65% position:50% align:center size:92%
Our son was born in America in November.

00:06:21.900 --> 00:06:26.760 line:65% position:50% align:center size:92%
I took two weeks' leave from Chung Hua
University to visit her.

00:06:26.760 --> 00:06:31.680 line:65% position:50% align:center size:92%
On the evening before my leave ended,

00:06:32.920 --> 00:06:40.980 line:65% position:50% align:center size:92%
my wife held our newborn son and said
something that hurt me deeply.

00:06:40.980 --> 00:06:45.980 line:65% position:50% align:center size:92%
Only years later did I understand that
it had been her cry for help.

00:06:45.980 --> 00:06:52.560 line:65% position:50% align:center size:92%
At the time, Liao returned to Taiwan
with a wounded heart.

00:06:53.300 --> 00:06:56.040 line:65% position:50% align:center size:92%
Over the next two years, separated by
time and distance,

00:06:56.040 --> 00:07:00.740 line:65% position:50% align:center size:92%
he could not understand why his wife
seemed to put her career before their
love.

00:07:02.000 --> 00:07:06.716 line:65% position:50% align:center size:92%
If graduation was so far away, why not
give up her studies and come home to be

00:07:06.716 --> 00:07:07.260 line:65% position:50% align:center size:92%
together?

00:07:07.260 --> 00:07:15.580 line:65% position:50% align:center size:92%
Even phone calls across thousands of
miles could not thaw his frozen heart.

00:07:16.100 --> 00:07:23.840 line:65% position:50% align:center size:92%
Without her emotional support, his wife
could only cry during their phone calls.

00:07:23.840 --> 00:07:31.080 line:65% position:50% align:center size:92%
In the lab, her fellow students came to
see her as a strange Asian girl.

00:07:31.940 --> 00:07:36.120 line:65% position:50% align:center size:92%
No one could talk with her, because she
would cry as soon as she began to speak.

00:07:36.920 --> 00:07:39.680 line:65% position:50% align:center size:92%
She was on the verge of breaking down.

00:07:40.900 --> 00:07:51.340 line:65% position:50% align:center size:92%
Then one day, a student from mainland
China who worked in the next lab passed

00:07:51.340 --> 00:07:52.560 line:65% position:50% align:center size:92%
her door.

00:07:53.120 --> 00:07:58.740 line:65% position:50% align:center size:92%
She felt God strongly urging her to go
inside and share the gospel.

00:07:58.740 --> 00:08:03.900 line:65% position:50% align:center size:92%
She had been a Christian only a few
years and was afraid to go in.

00:08:03.900 --> 00:08:12.643 line:65% position:50% align:center size:92%
But the urging persisted, so she timidly
entered the lab and shared the gospel

00:08:12.643 --> 00:08:14.100 line:65% position:50% align:center size:92%
with my wife.

00:08:14.600 --> 00:08:21.080 line:65% position:50% align:center size:92%
As she read the gospel leaflet aloud and
reached the words, There is a Savior,

00:08:21.080 --> 00:08:27.759 line:65% position:50% align:center size:92%
my wife was like a drowning person who
suddenly found a strong arm that could

00:08:27.759 --> 00:08:28.540 line:65% position:50% align:center size:92%
save her.

00:08:29.080 --> 00:08:33.920 line:65% position:50% align:center size:92%
That was how she was brought into the
church, saved, and became a Christian.

00:08:33.920 --> 00:08:43.022 line:65% position:50% align:center size:92%
After she believed, her heart grew
stronger and more joyful. Her life
changed

00:08:43.022 --> 00:08:44.440 line:65% position:50% align:center size:92%
wonderfully.

00:08:45.220 --> 00:08:50.387 line:65% position:50% align:center size:92%
The brothers and sisters in the church
were not relatives, yet willingly cooked

00:08:50.387 --> 00:08:52.480 line:65% position:50% align:center size:92%
and brought her meals every day.

00:08:54.450 --> 00:08:57.130 line:65% position:50% align:center size:92%
To him, this was almost beyond belief.

00:08:58.470 --> 00:09:02.450 line:65% position:50% align:center size:92%
The following summer, he went to America
again to visit his wife.

00:09:03.630 --> 00:09:07.990 line:65% position:50% align:center size:92%
She often took him to church meetings
that he did not enjoy.

00:09:09.310 --> 00:09:14.022 line:65% position:50% align:center size:92%
Watching them earnestly read the Bible
and sing praises to God, he could not

00:09:14.022 --> 00:09:14.890 line:65% position:50% align:center size:92%
understand it.

00:09:15.950 --> 00:09:20.438 line:65% position:50% align:center size:92%
They often asked whether he enjoyed the
meetings and whether he wanted to be

00:09:20.438 --> 00:09:20.970 line:65% position:50% align:center size:92%
baptized.

00:09:22.010 --> 00:09:28.791 line:65% position:50% align:center size:92%
He was unconvinced, but they had been so
kind to his family that he did not want

00:09:28.791 --> 00:09:30.910 line:65% position:50% align:center size:92%
to reject their goodwill.

00:09:30.910 --> 00:09:33.850 line:65% position:50% align:center size:92%
So he politely put them off.

00:09:34.690 --> 00:09:39.350 line:65% position:50% align:center size:92%
Then came Thursday, July 23, 1998.

00:09:39.350 --> 00:09:41.890 line:65% position:50% align:center size:92%
I decided I would no longer let them
bother me.
